+### Shell Scripts
+
+#### test_benchmark.sh
+**Purpose**: Automated benchmark testing script that finds and runs all built benchmark executables.
+
+**Features**:
+- Automatic build directory detection
+- Batch execution of multiple benchmarks
+- CSV result collection
